{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "group-spectral",
      "type": "group",
      "x": -100,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 2600,
      "height": 1070,
      "label": "一、对称、Hermitian 与标准正交谱结构",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "group-quadratic",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 2700,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 3050,
      "height": 1270,
      "label": "二、二次型、定号与谱后果",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "group-tests",
      "type": "group",
      "x": -100,
      "y": 1300,
      "width": 3150,
      "height": 1090,
      "label": "三、完整判据与常见误判",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "group-applications",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 3250,
      "y": 1300,
      "width": 2500,
      "height": 1090,
      "label": "四、几何、优化与协方差",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "header",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -100,
      "y": -300,
      "width": 5850,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "# 对称矩阵与正定二次型\n\n先认清实数域与复数域中的结构，再用谱坐标读二次型的符号；完整判据、失败边界和应用分别展开。箭头表示学习依赖或需要紧邻辨析的关系。"
    },
    {
      "id": "footer",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -100,
      "y": 2460,
      "width": 5850,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "**颜色只表示本图中的语义角色：** 青色是定义，紫色是定理或等价，红色是边界或反例，黄色是解释或应用，绿色是综合判断。颜色不表示掌握程度。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n001",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 100,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[实对称矩阵|Real symmetric matrices]]\n\nA real square matrix satisfies $A^T=A$: entries mirrored across the diagonal agree. Symmetry alone does not imply positive definiteness.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n实方阵转置不变：主对角线两侧镜像位置相等。仅对称不保证正定。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n002",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 650,
      "y": 100,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[正交矩阵|Orthogonal matrix]]\n\nA real square $Q$ satisfies $Q^TQ=I$. Its transpose is its inverse; it preserves inner products and lengths.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n实方阵各列标准正交，转置即逆。一般不要求 $Q$ 自身对称。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n003",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1300,
      "y": 100,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 240,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[Hermitian 矩阵|Hermitian matrices]]\nA complex square matrix is Hermitian when $A=A^*$, where $*$ is conjugate transpose. Reflected entries are conjugate pairs; diagonal entries are real. With real entries this is ordinary symmetry.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**Hermitian 矩阵**：复方阵等于自身共轭转置：镜像元素互为共轭，对角元为实数。全部元素为实时，就是通常的对称矩阵。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n004",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1950,
      "y": 100,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[Unitary 矩阵|Unitary matrices]]\nA finite complex square matrix $U$ is unitary when $U^*U=I$. Here $*$ is conjugate transpose. Then $U^{-1}=U^*$, and standard lengths and inner products are preserved.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**Unitary 矩阵**：有限复方阵满足 $U^*U=I$ 即为酉矩阵，$*$ 是共轭转置。此时 $U^{-1}=U^*$，保持标准长度和内积。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n007",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 325,
      "y": 420,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[实对称矩阵谱定理|Real spectral theorem]]\nEvery finite real symmetric matrix has real eigenvalues and an orthonormal eigenbasis: $A=Q\\Lambda Q^T$. Such a basis can also be chosen when eigenvalues repeat.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**实对称矩阵谱定理**：有限阶实对称矩阵有实特征值和标准正交特征基，可写成 $A=Q\\Lambda Q^T$。特征值重复时仍可选出这样的基。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n008",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1625,
      "y": 420,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[Hermitian 谱定理|Hermitian spectral theorem]]\nFor finite complex Hermitian $A$, $A=U\\Lambda U^*$ with real diagonal $\\Lambda$ and unitary $U$. Its columns are an orthonormal eigenbasis; $*$ denotes conjugate transpose.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**Hermitian 谱定理**：有限阶复 Hermitian 矩阵可写成 $A=U\\Lambda U^*$，其中 $\\Lambda$ 为实对角矩阵、$U$ 为 unitary。$U$ 的列构成标准正交特征基；$*$ 是共轭转置。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n005",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 650,
      "y": 740,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[Normal 矩阵|Normal matrices]]\nA finite complex square matrix is normal when $A^*A=AA^*$: it commutes with its conjugate transpose. Hermitian and unitary matrices are subclasses. Normality does not guarantee length preservation.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**Normal 矩阵**：有限复方阵与共轭转置可交换，即 $A^*A=AA^*$，称为正规。Hermitian 与酉矩阵都是其子类；正规性本身不保证保持长度。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n006",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1300,
      "y": 740,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[Normal 矩阵谱定理|Normal spectral theorem]]\nA finite complex square $A$ has a full orthonormal eigenbasis exactly when it is normal. Then $A=U\\Lambda U^*$ with unitary $U$ and diagonal $\\Lambda$. Eigenvalues may be complex or repeated.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**Normal 矩阵谱定理**：有限复方阵正规，当且仅当有完整标准正交特征基；此时 $A=U\\Lambda U^*$，$U$ 为酉矩阵、$\\Lambda$ 为对角矩阵。特征值可为复数或重复。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n030",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1950,
      "y": 740,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[Unitary不等于Hermitian|Unitary versus Hermitian]]\nUnitary means $A^*=A^{-1}$; Hermitian means $A^*=A$. Neither implies the other: $[i]$ is only unitary, $[2]$ only Hermitian. A unitary eigenbasis matrix does not make the original matrix unitary.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**Unitary不等于Hermitian**：酉要求 $A^*=A^{-1}$，Hermitian 要求 $A^*=A$，互不推出：$[i]$ 仅有前者，$[2]$ 仅有后者。特征基矩阵为酉，不代表原矩阵为酉。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n025",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2800,
      "y": 100,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[二次型|Quadratic forms]]\nA real quadratic form is a homogeneous quadratic polynomial $q(x)=x^TAx$. Paired off-diagonal entries combine into cross terms; replacing $x$ by $tx$ multiplies $q$ by $t^2$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**二次型**：实二次型是 $q(x)=x^TAx$ 这样的二次齐次多项式。成对的非对角元合成交叉项；输入乘 $t$，输出乘 $t^2$。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n009",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3450,
      "y": 100,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[二次型对称化|Symmetrizing a form]]\nFor real $x$, $x^TAx=x^TSx$ with $S=(A+A^T)/2$. In fixed coordinates, $S$ is the unique symmetric representative; the matrix spectrum need not be preserved.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**二次型对称化**：对实 $x$，取 $S=(A+A^T)/2$ 得同一二次型。固定坐标下，$S$ 是唯一对称代表，但不一定保持原矩阵的谱。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n028",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4100,
      "y": 100,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[复二次型实部|Real part of a complex form]]\nFor any complex square $A$, set $H=(A+A^*)/2$. Then $\\operatorname{Re}(z^*Az)=z^*Hz$ for every $z$. Taking real parts of the entries of $A$ is a different operation.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**复二次型实部**：任意复方阵取 $H=(A+A^*)/2$，都有 $\\operatorname{Re}(z^*Az)=z^*Hz$。这里是 Hermitian 部分，不是逐个矩阵元素取实部。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n034",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4750,
      "y": 100,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[Hermitian二次型实值判据|Real-valued quadratic forms]]\nFor a complex $n\\times n$ matrix, $n\\ge1$, $z^*Az$ is real for every $z\\in\\mathbb C^n$ iff $A=A^*$. Here $*$ means conjugate transpose. Real inputs alone are insufficient.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**Hermitian二次型实值判据**：复方阵满足 $A=A^*$，当且仅当对全部复向量 $z$，$z^*Az$ 都为实数。$*$ 为共轭转置；只检查实向量不够。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n010",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2800,
      "y": 420,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[正定矩阵|Positive definite]]\nReal symmetric $A$ is positive definite when $x^TAx>0$ for every $x\\ne0$. For complex Hermitian $A$, use $x^*Ax$, with $*$ the conjugate transpose.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**正定矩阵**：实对称 $A$ 要求每个 $x\\ne0$ 都有 $x^TAx>0$；复 Hermitian 情形改用 $x^*Ax$，$*$ 为共轭转置。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n011",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3450,
      "y": 420,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 270,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[半正定矩阵|Positive semidefinite]]\nReal symmetric $A$ has $x^TAx\\ge0$ for every $x$; complex Hermitian $A$ uses $x^*Ax$. Positive definite matrices are included. A nonzero zero-value direction is allowed, not required.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**半正定矩阵**：实对称情形要求所有 $x$ 的二次型非负；复 Hermitian 情形用共轭转置。这包括正定矩阵，允许但不要求存在非零零值方向。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n012",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4100,
      "y": 420,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[正定与半正定的谱判据|Eigenvalue sign tests]]\nFor real symmetric or complex Hermitian $A$, positive definiteness means all eigenvalues are positive; positive semidefiniteness means all are nonnegative. The latter permits, but does not require, zero.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**正定与半正定的谱判据**：实对称或复 Hermitian 矩阵：正定等价于特征值全正，半正定等价于特征值全非负。后者允许但不要求零特征值。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n031",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4750,
      "y": 420,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 270,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[正定谱下界|Uniform spectral bound]]\nFor fixed finite real symmetric or Hermitian $A$, positive definiteness is equivalent to $x^*Ax\\ge c\\|x\\|_2^2$ for all $x$, with one $c>0$ independent of $x$. The largest such $c$ is the smallest eigenvalue.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**正定谱下界**：对固定的有限阶实对称或 Hermitian 矩阵，正定等价于用同一个 $c>0$ 对全部 $x$ 保证上述下界；$c$ 不随 $x$ 变。最优值是最小特征值。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n032",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2800,
      "y": 740,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[半正定零方向|Zero directions and the kernel]]\nFor real symmetric $A\\succeq0$, $x^TAx=0$ iff $Ax=0$. For complex Hermitian $A\\succeq0$, use $x^*$, the conjugate transpose. An indefinite form can have zero values outside its kernel.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**半正定零方向**：实对称半正定时，二次型为零恰好等价于矩阵把该向量映为零。复 Hermitian 情形用共轭转置；不定二次型可在核以外取零。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n017",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3450,
      "y": 740,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[半正定主平方根|Principal square root]]\nA finite real symmetric or Hermitian positive-semidefinite $A$ has exactly one positive-semidefinite $B$ with $B^2=A$. It takes nonnegative square roots of eigenvalues; zero is allowed. This is not entrywise square rooting.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**半正定主平方根**：有限阶实对称或 Hermitian 半正定矩阵 $A$，有唯一半正定平方根 $B$ 满足 $B^2=A$。对特征值取非负平方根，允许零；并非逐个矩阵元素开方。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n036",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4100,
      "y": 1040,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[正定逆平方根|Inverse square root]]\nFor finite positive-definite real symmetric/Hermitian $A$, $W=(A^{1/2})^{-1}$ satisfies $WAW=I$. A singular semidefinite $A$ has a principal root but no ordinary inverse root.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**正定逆平方根**：有限阶实对称或 Hermitian 正定矩阵的 $W=(A^{1/2})^{-1}$ 满足 $WAW=I$。奇异半正定矩阵有主平方根，却无普通逆平方根。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n020",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4100,
      "y": 740,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[正定与半正定可逆性|When PSD is invertible]]\nFor real symmetric or Hermitian $A$, positive definiteness is equivalent to positive semidefiniteness plus invertibility. Semidefiniteness alone allows either outcome; invertibility alone gives no positive sign.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**正定与半正定可逆性**：实对称或 Hermitian 矩阵正定，当且仅当它半正定且可逆。仅半正定可以奇异，也可以可逆；仅可逆不保证正性。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n033",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4750,
      "y": 740,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[正定逆仍正定|Positive-definite inverse]]\nA finite real symmetric or Hermitian positive-definite matrix has a positive-definite inverse. Its eigenvalues are the positive reciprocals of the original eigenvalues; taking reciprocals reverses their order.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**正定逆仍正定**：有限阶实对称或 Hermitian 正定矩阵的逆仍正定。逆矩阵的特征值是原正特征值的倒数，大小顺序随之反转。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n013",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1420,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 270,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[LDL正定判别|Positive LDL pivots]]\nFor finite real symmetric or Hermitian $A$, positive definiteness is equivalent to $A=LDL^*$ with unit lower triangular $L$ and positive diagonal $D$. Here $*$ is conjugate transpose; over the reals it is transpose.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**LDL正定判别**：有限阶实对称或 Hermitian 矩阵正定，等价于上述分解存在，且 $L$ 为单位下三角、$D$ 对角元全正。$*$ 表示共轭转置，实数时就是转置。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n014",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 650,
      "y": 1420,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[Sylvester 正定判据|Sylvester’s criterion]]\nA real symmetric or Hermitian matrix is positive definite iff all its [[顺序主子式|leading principal minors]] are strictly positive. Replacing $>0$ by $\\ge0$ does not give a semidefinite test.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**Sylvester 正定判据**：实对称或 Hermitian 矩阵正定，当且仅当全部[[顺序主子式]]严格为正。不能只把严格号换成非严格号来判半正定。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n016",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1300,
      "y": 1420,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[Cholesky 正定判据|Cholesky criterion]]\nA finite real symmetric or Hermitian matrix is positive definite exactly when $A=LL^*$ with lower triangular $L$ and positive real diagonal. For a fixed coordinate order this normalized factor is unique.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**Cholesky 正定判据**：有限阶实对称或 Hermitian 矩阵正定，等价于存在正实数对角的下三角因子 $L$，使 $A=LL^*$。坐标顺序固定后，这个规范化因子唯一。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n015",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1950,
      "y": 1420,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[半正定主子式判别|PSD minor test]]\nFor a finite real symmetric or complex Hermitian matrix, positive semidefiniteness is equivalent to every principal minor being nonnegative. Check every nonempty same-index row/column selection; zero is allowed.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**半正定主子式判别**：有限阶实对称或复 Hermitian 矩阵半正定，等价于全部主子式非负。须检查每个非空的同组行列下标选择；允许零。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n027",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1760,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[LDL零主元边界|Zero-pivot boundary]]\nA zero scalar pivot may block the usual division-based recurrence; it does not by itself imply that the whole matrix is singular. For singular semidefinite matrices, zero pivots can also leave a triangular factor nonunique.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**LDL零主元边界**：零标量主元可能阻断通常的除法递推，但本身不说明整个矩阵奇异。对奇异半正定矩阵，零主元也可能使三角因子不唯一。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n018",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 650,
      "y": 1760,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[正对角元的正定边界|Positive diagonal]]\nFor real symmetric matrices, positive definiteness forces every diagonal entry to be positive. In dimension at least two, those axis checks can still miss a negative mixed direction.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**正对角元的正定边界**：实对称矩阵正定必有正对角元。但至少二维时，坐标轴检查仍可能漏掉混合方向上的负二次值。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n019",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1950,
      "y": 1760,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[正行列式的正定边界|Positive determinant]]\nFor a real symmetric matrix, a positive determinant allows an even number of negative eigenvalues. From dimension two onward it does not by itself imply positive definiteness; dimension one is different.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**正行列式的正定边界**：实对称矩阵的正行列式仍允许偶数个负特征值。从二维起，仅凭正行列式不能推出正定；一维是例外。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n026",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2600,
      "y": 1760,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[顺序主子式不推半正定|Weak leading signs fail]]\nThe diagonal matrix with entries $0,-1$ has both leading minors zero, but its second coordinate gives a negative quadratic value. For dimension at least two, nonnegative leading minors alone cannot certify semidefiniteness.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**顺序主子式不推半正定**：对角元为 $0,-1$ 的矩阵，两个顺序主子式都为零，第二坐标方向却取负。至少二维时，仅顺序主子式非负不足以保证半正定。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n024",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1300,
      "y": 2100,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[正定判据的选择|Choosing a positivity test]]\nFirst confirm real symmetry or Hermitian symmetry. Then use one complete certificate: all eigenvalues positive, all positive leading minors, or a scalar $LDL^*$ factorization with positive diagonal $D$. A positive determinant alone is insufficient.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**正定判据的选择**：先确认实对称或 Hermitian，再选一个完整证书：特征值全正、顺序主子式全正，或 $D$ 对角元全正的标量 $LDL^*$ 分解。仅行列式为正还不够。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n021",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3350,
      "y": 1420,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[正定二次型的椭球|Ellipsoids from quadratic forms]]\n\nFor real symmetric $A\\succ0$, $x^TAx=1$ is an ellipsoid boundary. Unit eigenvectors give its axis directions; eigenvalues $\\lambda_i>0$ give semiaxes $1/\\sqrt{\\lambda_i}$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n等号给出边界，$x^TAx\\le1$ 包含内部。代价越大的方向，半轴越短；半正定含零方向时可能变成无界圆柱。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n022",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4000,
      "y": 1420,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 270,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[Hessian 局部极小判据|Hessian minimum test]]\nFor real scalar $f\\in C^2$ near an interior stationary point $a$, positive-definite $H_f(a)$ guarantees a strict local minimum. This is sufficient, not necessary.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**Hessian 局部极小判据**：实值函数在内点驻点附近为 $C^2$，且 Hessian 正定，便有严格局部极小。这是充分条件，不是必要条件。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n029",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4650,
      "y": 1420,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 290,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[半定Hessian无结论|Singular semidefinite Hessians]]\nAt an interior stationary point of a real $C^2$ function, singular semidefiniteness leaves classification incomplete. A nonzero positive-semidefinite Hessian still rules out a local maximum.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**半定Hessian无结论**：实值 $C^2$ 函数在内点驻点的奇异半定 Hessian 不能完成分类；但非零半正定仍排除局部极大。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n023",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3675,
      "y": 1760,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[协方差矩阵半正定性|Covariance is PSD]]\n\nFor a real random vector with finite second moments, $a^T\\Sigma a=\\operatorname{Var}(a^TX)\\ge0$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n每个固定线性组合的方差非负，协方差又对称。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n035",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4325,
      "y": 1760,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[协方差奇异性|Singular covariance]]\n\nWith finite second moments, singularity means some fixed $a\\ne0$ has $a^TX=E[a^TX]$ almost surely.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n非零零空间方向对应确定的线性组合；常数可非零。"
    },
    {
      "id": "sofp-nd",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 2900,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 250,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[负定矩阵|Negative definite]]\nFor real symmetric $A$, $x^TAx<0$ for every $x\\ne0$; equivalently, $-A$ is positive definite. For complex Hermitian $A$, test $z^*Az$ instead.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**负定矩阵**：实对称 $A$ 在每个非零向量上二次型严格负，等价于 $-A$ 正定。复 Hermitian 情形改检验 $z^*Az$。"
    },
    {
      "id": "sofp-nsd",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 470,
      "y": 2900,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 250,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[半负定矩阵|Negative semidefinite]]\nFor real symmetric $A$, $x^TAx\\le0$ for all $x$. This includes negative-definite matrices and zero; a nonzero zero-value direction is allowed, not required.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**半负定矩阵**：实对称 $A$ 在所有向量上二次型非正。这包括负定与零矩阵；允许但不要求存在非零零值方向。"
    },
    {
      "id": "sofp-indef",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 940,
      "y": 2900,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 250,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[不定二次型|Indefinite forms]]\nA real quadratic form $q$ is indefinite when $q(u)>0$ and $q(v)<0$ for some vectors $u,v$. A zero value alone proves neither indefiniteness nor a nonzero nullspace.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**不定二次型**：实二次型须有实际正值方向和负值方向才称不定。单个零值既不能证明不定，也不能证明矩阵有非零零空间。"
    },
    {
      "id": "sofp-complete",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1410,
      "y": 2900,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 260,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[二维二次型配方|Completing two squares]]\nFor real $q=ax^2+2bxy+cy^2$ and $a\\ne0$, completing the square gives $q=a(x+by/a)^2+(c-b^2/a)y^2$. The invertible coordinate change exposes the signs. Treat $a=0$ separately.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**二维二次型配方**：实二次型在 $a\\ne0$ 时按上式配方，可逆换坐标后直接检查平方项的系数。$a=0$ 时须另行判断，不能除以零。"
    },
    {
      "id": "sofp-ndtest",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 3170,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 250,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[负定顺序主子式判据|Negative-definite test]]\nFor real symmetric or complex Hermitian $A$, negative definiteness is equivalent to every leading minor having a strict alternating sign: odd order negative, even order positive.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**负定顺序主子式判据**：实对称或复 Hermitian 矩阵负定，等价于全部顺序主子式严格交替：奇数阶负，偶数阶正。每阶都须检查。"
    },
    {
      "id": "sofp-nsdtest",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 470,
      "y": 3170,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[半负定主子式判据|Negative-semidefinite test]]\nFor real symmetric or complex Hermitian $A$, negative semidefiniteness is equivalent to all principal minors having weak signs by order: odd nonpositive, even nonnegative. Zero is permitted, not required.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**半负定主子式判据**：实对称或复 Hermitian 矩阵半负定，等价于全部主子式按阶数取弱符号：奇数阶非正，偶数阶非负。允许零，不要求零。"
    },
    {
      "id": "sofp-qhessian",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1410,
      "y": 3170,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 250,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[二次型的Hessian|Quadratic Hessians]]\nFor fixed real $A$ and $q(x)=x^TAx$, $H_q=A+A^T$. If $A$ is symmetric this is $2A$; the Hessian of $\\tfrac12x^TAx$ is then $A$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**二次型的Hessian**：固定实矩阵 $A$ 给出 $H_q=A+A^T$；对称时为 $2A$。若函数前有 $\\tfrac12$，对称情形的 Hessian 就是 $A$。"
    },
    {
      "id": "p0016-outer-psd",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3350,
      "y": 2100,
      "width": 650,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[外积和的半正定性|Finite outer-product sums]]\n\nFor real or complex columns and fixed $w_i\\ge0$, $\\sum_iw_iv_iv_i^*$ is PSD: each quadratic value is a sum of absolute squares.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n有限非负加权和保留半正定；复数必须用共轭转置，半正定不保证可逆。"
    }
  ],
